@startuml
title AIP-20 Token wired to CMTATAztecAuth — private transfer, burn and the hook

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260

actor Holder
box "Client side — proved on the holder's device" #F4F8FC
participant "Token (aztec-standards)\ntransfer_private_to_private(from, to, amount, nonce)\nburn_private(from, amount, nonce)" as Tok
participant "CMTATAztecAuth\nauthorize_private(from, amount, selector)" as Auth
participant "Public state\n(historical read at the anchor block)" as PS
end box
box "Sequencer — public phase of the same transaction" #FFF8E8
participant "CMTATAztecAuth\n_require_lifecycle_allows(is_burn)\nonly_self" as AuthPub
participant "Token\ndecrease_total_supply_internal\n(burn only)" as TokPub
end box

Holder -> Tok : transfer_private_to_private / burn_private
Tok -> Tok : authwit check (authorize_once)
Tok -> Auth : self.call(auth_contract.authorize_private(from, amount, selector))
note over Tok, Auth
  ARC-403: the token passes the spender, the amount and its own selector.
  It never passes `to` (nor the initiator), so nothing below can screen the recipient.
end note

group Rules a private function can evaluate — DelayedPublicMutable, 360 s to bite
  Auth -> PS : is_frozen(from)
  Auth -> Auth : assert not frozen ("Frozen: from address")
  Auth -> PS : operations flag, list entry of from
  Auth -> Auth : blacklist mode: assert from not listed\nwhitelist mode: assert from listed
end

Auth -> Auth : is_burn = selector ∈ {burn_private 0xc282ed79, burn_public 0xc611b0c5}
Auth -> AuthPub : enqueue_self _require_lifecycle_allows(is_burn)
note over Auth, AuthPub
  The pause and deactivation flags are PublicMutable — immediate, as an emergency
  lever must be — so they cannot be read here. The enqueued call carries ONE boolean.
  from, amount and to are never published.
end note
Auth --> Tok : ok

Tok -> Tok : nullify from's notes, create change note\n(transfer: recipient note for `to`)
alt burn
  Tok -> TokPub : enqueue decrease_total_supply_internal(amount)
end

== Public phase ==
AuthPub -> AuthPub : is_burn ? assert not deactivated\n        : assert not paused
alt refused
  AuthPub --> Holder : revert — the whole transaction fails,\nprivate half included
end
TokPub -> TokPub : total_supply -= amount (burn only)

@enduml
